OneTimeUseIdPolicy::isUsed
├── given the id has never been burned for the account under the multiplexer
│   └── it should return false
├── given checkAction validated the burn under the multiplexer
│   └── it should return true
├── given the burn was validated under a different multiplexer
│   └── it should return false
└── given the burn happened in an earlier transaction
    └── it should still return true (the durable record survives)
